ploy, v2.3.1, was failing health checks in us-east, us-west and eu-west, with an 18% error rate. Its pre-release build, v2.3.1-rc, was also marked unhealthy in the release history.\n- **Rollback:** v2.3.0 was the most recent healthy release. Because it has been healthy in production before, it didn't need change-manager approval.\n- **After:** all three regions are on v2.3.0, health checks pass, and the error rate is 0.2%.\n- **Incident:** it describes the failure and the rollback, and notes that the v2.3.1 problem needs a root cause before anyone redeploys it.", "type": "text"}]}]}